        "Node name for S&R": "AUSBOSS_NODES_WorkflowNote",
        "ver": "2.0.0"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"v\": 1, \"title\": \"Image and Video Transform\", \"subtitle\": \"Explore both editors, inspect generated-area masks, and align the final image.\", \"author\": \"AusBoss\", \"layout\": \"card\", \"body\": \"## Setup\\nCopy the included pier PNG and MP4 from example_workflows/inputs into ComfyUI/input. No models or extra packs are needed.\\n\\n## Image editor\\nDrag the crop, padding and rotation handles on Image Crop + Rotate + Pad, or open its full-screen editor. The sample starts with a slight rotation and visible padding so the generated-area mask is easy to inspect.\\n\\n## Alignment\\nAlign Image pads the transformed image to a multiple of 64. Compare shows that aligned result against the transform. Alignment outputs the image and dimensions; the mask preview is from the transform before alignment. Use Image Resize with an input mask if image and mask must follow one resize together.\\n\\n## Video frame editor\\nThe Frame variant selects exactly one frame. Move the timeline, then queue to update the image and mask previews. For a whole trimmed sequence, use the Clip variant as shown in the LTX example.\\n\\n## Gesture guide\\nCyan squares crop, orange diamonds pad, green rotates. Shift snaps rotation. Wheel zoom and middle-button pan belong to the full-screen editor; on the compact stage they still navigate the graph.\", \"models\": [], \"packs\": []}"
      ]
    },
